{
    "title": "Betr Fantasy & Sportsbook",
    "description": "Are you ready to take your fantasy sports and sports betting experience to the next level?\r\n\r\nLook no further! Betr Fantasy & Sportsbook is your go-to online sports gaming destination for:\r\n\r\nBetr Picks - a new and exciting pick'em style DFS (daily fantasy sports) game\r\nBetr Sportsbook - sports betting supercharged with microbets, game outcomes, parlays, props, and more coming soon.\r\n\r\nLeverage fast and secure deposits and withdrawals through PayPal, Bank Transfers, or Debit Cards.\r\n\r\n\u2014-------\r\n\r\nWhy Betr Picks?\r\n\r\nThe new way to play for real cash! Make your picks of More or Less for 2 or more (up to 8) players for payouts of 3x to 1000x your initial entry.\r\n\r\nPayouts Up to 1000x\r\n\r\nBetr Picks takes the traditional pick'em concept and amplifies it with the ability to win up to 1000x your entry if you correctly select up to 8 picks! Choose wisely and watch your winnings soar! Look for Boosted, Discounted, and Free Picks to build your best lineups!\r\n\r\nDynamic Play\r\n\r\nBad picks don\u2019t mean game over! Win money with up to 2 misses. It\u2019s not over if one of the players in your lineup gets injured!\r\n\r\nNo Pushes\r\n\r\nForget about frustrating ties and pushes. Betr Picks keeps the excitement flowing with no pushes allowed. Every pick counts, and every decision matters as you strive for victory.\r\n\r\nUnleash Your Fantasy Skills\r\n\r\nBetr Picks covers a wide range of sports, including NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, UFC, and more! Whether you're a seasoned sports fan, DFS sharp, or a casual enthusiast, our app offers an extensive selection of player projections to cater to your interests. Dive into the action, analyze the stats, and trust your instincts to make the winning picks.\r\n\r\n\u2014--------\r\n\r\nWhy Betr Sportsbook?\r\n\r\nMake every moment count with microbets on your favorite sporting events. Betr provides a unique experience with a simple and intuitive offering for each U.S. sport:\r\n\r\nFootball (NFL & CFB):\r\n\r\nWhat will the next play be: Run or Pass?\r\nWhat will the exact result of the team\u2019s next drive be: Touchdown, Field Goal, Punt, or Turnover?\r\nWho will score the next touchdown?\r\nWho will catch the next pass?\r\n+ Much more!\r\n\r\nBasketball (NBA & CBB):\r\n\r\nWhich team will score next?\r\nWhat will the exact result of the team\u2019s next possession be: 2-Pointer, 3-Pointer, Free Throw, Missed Field Goal, or Turnover?\r\nWill a player\u2019s next made field goal be a 2-pointer or 3-pointer?\r\n+ Much more! \r\n\r\nBaseball (MLB):\r\n\r\nWhat will the next pitch result be: Ball, Strike, or In-Play?\r\nWhat will the next at-bat result be: Single, Double, Triple, Home Run, Walk, Reached on Error, or Out?\r\n+ Much more!\r\n\r\nAvailable in Multiple States\r\n\r\nBetr Sportsbook is currently live in Ohio and Virginia with more states on the way!\r\n\r\n\u2014--------\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on the next level of fantasy sports and real money sports betting. Download Betr Fantasy & Sportsbook today and let the games begin!\r\n--------\r\n\r\nBetr Fantasy & Sportsbook requires age and location verification and is only available in certain states where real money fantasy sports and/or sports betting is legal. The free-to-play version of Betr Sportsbook is available in 48 states (not available in Nevada, Washington, or where prohibited or restricted by law).\r\n\r\n*T&Cs apply.\r\n\r\nThis is a real-money gambling app. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford. For gambling addiction help and support, please contact National Council on Problem Gambling at 1-800-522-4700, or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/\r\n\r\nMust be 21 years of age or older to participate.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you ready to take your fantasy sports and sports betting experience to the next level?<br><br>Look no further! Betr Fantasy &amp; Sportsbook is your go-to online sports gaming destination for:<br><br>Betr Picks - a new and exciting pick&#39;em style DFS (daily fantasy sports) game<br>Betr Sportsbook - sports betting supercharged with microbets, game outcomes, parlays, props, and more coming soon.<br><br>Leverage fast and secure deposits and withdrawals through PayPal, Bank Transfers, or Debit Cards.<br><br>\u2014-------<br><br>Why Betr Picks?<br><br>The new way to play for real cash! Make your picks of More or Less for 2 or more (up to 8) players for payouts of 3x to 1000x your initial entry.<br><br>Payouts Up to 1000x<br><br>Betr Picks takes the traditional pick&#39;em concept and amplifies it with the ability to win up to 1000x your entry if you correctly select up to 8 picks! Choose wisely and watch your winnings soar! Look for Boosted, Discounted, and Free Picks to build your best lineups!<br><br>Dynamic Play<br><br>Bad picks don\u2019t mean game over! Win money with up to 2 misses. It\u2019s not over if one of the players in your lineup gets injured!<br><br>No Pushes<br><br>Forget about frustrating ties and pushes. Betr Picks keeps the excitement flowing with no pushes allowed. Every pick counts, and every decision matters as you strive for victory.<br><br>Unleash Your Fantasy Skills<br><br>Betr Picks covers a wide range of sports, including NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, UFC, and more! Whether you&#39;re a seasoned sports fan, DFS sharp, or a casual enthusiast, our app offers an extensive selection of player projections to cater to your interests. Dive into the action, analyze the stats, and trust your instincts to make the winning picks.<br><br>\u2014--------<br><br>Why Betr Sportsbook?<br><br>Make every moment count with microbets on your favorite sporting events. Betr provides a unique experience with a simple and intuitive offering for eac